@startuml
actor Player
boundary "Save UI and mission" as UI
participant "Map-owned state capture" as State
participant ForestSaveSlots
participant "Scene restore" as Restore
Player -> UI : Save the selected slot
UI -> State : Check stable state and capture payload
State --> UI : Return validated checkpoint and metadata
UI -> ForestSaveSlots : Write temp and atomically replace slot
ForestSaveSlots --> Player : Return saved or precise error
Player -> UI : Load a selected slot
UI -> ForestSaveSlots : Read and validate the envelope
ForestSaveSlots -> Restore : Load target scene and checkpoint
Restore -> State : Validate and restore actors props and input
Restore --> Player : Continue without duplicate rewards
@enduml
